1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:05,750
Dang... I finally climbed up the ladder
enough to get a TV appearance.

2
00:00:05,750 --> 00:00:09,630
These greenrooms sure do
make you restless, though.

3
00:00:09,630 --> 00:00:11,570
Reigen-san, you're up.

4
00:00:15,730 --> 00:00:17,240
All right. Let's do this.

5
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,990
Tea

6
00:00:17,240 --> 00:00:19,990
Supernatural Detective!
Do Spiritual Powers Actually Exist!?
Special

7
00:01:40,280 --> 00:01:45,120
Mob Psycho

8
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,000
_______________________________
_______________________________

9
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:52,000
A boy was possessed by a fox after
playing Kokkuri-san after school!?

10
00:01:51,430 --> 00:01:55,680
Oh, this must be it.
Jodo-sama's return to TV.

11
00:01:57,610 --> 00:01:59,130
R-Reigen?!

12
00:01:59,130 --> 00:02:01,080
What the heck is he doing?

13
00:02:01,740 --> 00:02:04,500
And now... Will we be able to save the poor,

14
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:07,480
Host

15
00:02:03,970 --> 00:02:07,480
Ebihara Morizo

16
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:07,480
unfortunate young man that's been possessed?

17
00:02:07,850 --> 00:02:12,200
Let's introduce our two powerful helpers!

18
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,440
The first one needs no introduction.

19
00:02:13,440 --> 00:02:18,150
The president of the Rising Sun
Spiritual Union, Jodo Kirin-sensei!

20
00:02:18,150 --> 00:02:23,280
Jodo Kirin

21
00:02:18,290 --> 00:02:23,280
He's solved devastating problems for many.
He's the best of the best!

22
00:02:23,570 --> 00:02:26,970
The other is making his
first appearance on TV.

23
00:02:26,970 --> 00:02:29,640
Reigen Arataka-sensei!

24
00:02:30,930 --> 00:02:34,020
Why, hello there. I'm Reigen Arataka.

25
00:02:34,020 --> 00:02:36,130
You can find my business in Seasoning City.

26
00:02:36,130 --> 00:02:40,590
Do Spiritual Powers Actually Exist!?

27
00:02:36,130 --> 00:02:40,590
Special!

28
00:02:36,390 --> 00:02:40,590
What are some of your accomplishments up till now, Reigen-sensei?

29
00:02:41,570 --> 00:02:44,010
It's hard to choose just one...

30
00:02:44,010 --> 00:02:46,710
Oh, but I did defeat the Dragger.

31
00:02:45,970 --> 00:02:48,270
Mogi Tatsuya

32
00:02:46,710 --> 00:02:48,270
Huh? That's awesome.

33
00:02:48,260 --> 00:02:51,480
Looks like we can expect great things.

34
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:54,010
And now, let's bring out the boy.

35
00:02:51,480 --> 00:02:57,940
Spooky

36
00:02:54,010 --> 00:02:57,490
To be extra careful,
since he may freak out,

37
00:02:57,490 --> 00:02:59,680
we have him securely bound.

38
00:03:05,370 --> 00:03:06,330
Go to Reigen-sensei!

39
00:03:06,330 --> 00:03:07,370
Go to Reigen-sensei!

40
00:03:07,370 --> 00:03:09,550
What do you think?

41
00:03:09,550 --> 00:03:10,920
I see...

42
00:03:10,920 --> 00:03:12,220
The footage we just watched

43
00:03:17,390 --> 00:03:18,340
But to be more precise,

44
00:03:18,340 --> 00:03:21,430
it's a ghost of a Rüppell's fox,
which are usually found in North Africa.

45
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:25,140
What's this? He was able to precisely
deduce the kind of ghost it is!

46
00:03:25,480 --> 00:03:27,760
What do you think, Jodo-sensei?

47
00:03:27,760 --> 00:03:30,350
The poor child...
being strapped down like that.

48
00:03:30,350 --> 00:03:32,910
I'm hoping we don't have to keep
those things on him much longer.

49
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:36,820
I see. So we all feel the same.

50
00:03:37,070 --> 00:03:41,460
And now, we're finally going to
witness the public exorcism!

51
00:03:41,460 --> 00:03:43,780
But before that,
a word from our sponsors.

52
00:03:46,580 --> 00:03:50,040
When we're back on air, we're going
to have Jodo-sensei do the exorcism.

53
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:54,430
Actually, why don't we have
Reigen-kun give it a shot?

54
00:03:54,430 --> 00:03:55,080
Wha—

55
00:03:55,080 --> 00:03:57,750
No one wants to see an old man.

56
00:03:58,020 --> 00:04:03,970
Let's show the country how
a next-generation psychic does things.

57
00:04:03,970 --> 00:04:08,060
Wasn't I just supposed to sit
there and comment today?

58
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:12,130
I'm trying to give you the spotlight here.

59
00:04:12,130 --> 00:04:14,370
But if you're not up to the task, very well.

60
00:04:14,370 --> 00:04:16,020
I'll do it, just as it says in the script.

61
00:04:16,440 --> 00:04:17,400
The script?

62
00:04:18,080 --> 00:04:19,170
I see!

63
00:04:19,530 --> 00:04:22,270
One moment! I'll do it after all.

64
00:04:24,130 --> 00:04:25,810
Okay... sure.

65
00:04:25,810 --> 00:04:28,360
Reigen-sensei's going to
perform the exorcism this time.

66
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,930
We're coming back from commercial!

67
00:04:30,790 --> 00:04:33,750
Supernatural Detective
Special!!

68
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:37,040
And it looks like we're just about
ready for this public exorcism.

69
00:04:37,280 --> 00:04:39,660
The one performing this exorcism

70
00:04:39,660 --> 00:04:42,870
is an exciting newcomer
who has had a meteoric rise!

71
00:04:42,870 --> 00:04:46,300
Reigen Arataka-sensei! Are you ready?

72
00:04:43,720 --> 00:04:46,300
Karaoke

73
00:04:46,600 --> 00:04:51,090
Leave it to me! I, Reigen Arataka,
shall accept this job!

74
00:04:51,090 --> 00:04:54,180
I shall successfully get rid of this spirit!

75
00:04:55,560 --> 00:04:59,350
Live or not, this is still a TV show.

76
00:04:59,350 --> 00:05:02,580
It's all a setup written by some scriptwriter.

77
00:05:03,190 --> 00:05:04,790
If I do some random exorcism,

78
00:05:04,790 --> 00:05:07,730
that'll quietly be the cue
for the boy to calm down

79
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:09,610
and the studio audience to clap.

80
00:05:09,950 --> 00:05:13,340
Then the host will praise me,
and the show will be over.

81
00:05:21,590 --> 00:05:23,710
Splashity Splash

82
00:05:21,900 --> 00:05:23,710
Salt Splash!

83
00:05:23,880 --> 00:05:27,180
And he just started throwing
a ton of salt outta nowhere!

84
00:05:27,670 --> 00:05:30,640
The spirit possessing the boy
seems to be struggling in agony.

85
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:33,100
It's working! It's really working!

86
00:05:33,430 --> 00:05:36,140
But it has never worked before!

87
00:05:36,430 --> 00:05:38,810
This kid is acting!

88
00:05:39,130 --> 00:05:43,280
Now that I know that,
I'm not pulling any punches!

89
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:47,200
Sorcery Crush Special!

90
00:05:47,400 --> 00:05:49,650
Air Banishing Salt...

91
00:05:50,020 --> 00:05:51,620
Punch!

92
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:54,080
A clean hit!

93
00:05:54,590 --> 00:05:58,840
Well, it's been about 30 minutes
since the exorcism started,

94
00:05:58,840 --> 00:06:01,880
but apparently, the spirit
just refuses to leave.

95
00:06:01,880 --> 00:06:04,120
Talk about resilient.

96
00:06:02,290 --> 00:06:04,120
Evil Spirit Detox Acupressure!

97
00:06:04,120 --> 00:06:05,340
Holy Water Chop!

98
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:07,240
For real!

99
00:06:07,240 --> 00:06:09,600
I've already used up all my special moves

100
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:11,760
Sorcery Crush

101
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:11,760
Aroma Runway Express

102
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:11,760
Salt Splash

103
00:06:07,550 --> 00:06:11,760
Graphic Exorcism

104
00:06:07,880 --> 00:06:11,760
Hypnosis Punch

105
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,760
and now I'm trying to keep
things going with ad-libs!

106
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:11,760
Banishing Salt Punch

107
00:06:10,090 --> 00:06:11,760
Cheeseburger Tornado

108
00:06:11,010 --> 00:06:11,760
Anti-Possession Jumping Knee Strike

109
00:06:11,900 --> 00:06:14,520
All right, let's have our
other psychic step in.

110
00:06:14,520 --> 00:06:15,260
Huh?

111
00:06:15,260 --> 00:06:18,140
Jodo Kirin-sensei, if you would.

112
00:06:20,760 --> 00:06:23,440
W-Wait... Was I just an opening act?

113
00:06:23,440 --> 00:06:25,650
Is he going to take all the glory?!

114
00:06:25,960 --> 00:06:28,360
Hang on a sec. I've almost got it.

115
00:06:28,360 --> 00:06:30,410
Switching right now would be—

116
00:06:30,410 --> 00:06:32,200
Look, we're live.

117
00:06:34,130 --> 00:06:36,910
Reigen-kun, good work the last 30 minutes.

118
00:06:37,580 --> 00:06:39,420
You wily, scheming old man!

119
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:42,750
All right, Jodo-sensei! Let's see you work!

120
00:06:42,930 --> 00:06:45,750
My spotlight!

121
00:06:45,990 --> 00:06:49,900
What am I supposed to exorcise here?
This boy isn't even possessed.

122
00:06:49,900 --> 00:06:50,970
He's just acting.

123
00:06:50,970 --> 00:06:51,990
Huh?

124
00:06:50,970 --> 00:06:51,990
S
a
y
w
h
a
?

125
00:06:53,800 --> 00:06:56,890
Oh, come on, you geezer!
Get a clue!

126
00:06:56,890 --> 00:06:59,860
Why'd you ruin all that setup
the program built up for you?!

127
00:06:59,860 --> 00:07:01,990
You are absolutely correct!

128
00:07:01,990 --> 00:07:04,610
I'm impressed you were able to see the truth

129
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:07,070
when everyone in the studio has
been tricked this whole time!

130
00:07:07,070 --> 00:07:14,370
A true psychic has just been revealed!

131
00:07:16,140 --> 00:07:19,880
My name is Fukuda Suzuo, and I'm a child
actor from the Mongolian Spot Agency!

132
00:07:19,880 --> 00:07:22,280
That was some brilliant acting!

133
00:07:22,280 --> 00:07:23,670
Thank you very much!

134
00:07:24,030 --> 00:07:26,700
I could barely tell he was acting!

135
00:07:26,700 --> 00:07:29,680
Sci-fi researcher, Mogi-san,
what did you think?

136
00:07:29,860 --> 00:07:33,340
I'd like to ask that gentleman over there

137
00:07:33,340 --> 00:07:35,640
what all that "exorcism" crap was about.

138
00:07:36,140 --> 00:07:39,600
What were you doing to a spirit
that didn't even exist?

139
00:07:39,860 --> 00:07:43,810
Reigen-sensei, I'm sure our viewers
are wondering that as well.

140
00:07:45,910 --> 00:07:48,570
Could it be... that you actually
don't have spiritual powers?

141
00:07:50,180 --> 00:07:54,460
Come, now. Let's just say
this is how he works.

142
00:07:54,460 --> 00:07:56,850
Excellent work, Jodo-sensei!

143
00:07:56,850 --> 00:08:01,050
It should've been completely obvious
if the boy was possessed or not...

144
00:08:01,050 --> 00:08:03,170
If you're a true psychic, that is.

145
00:08:03,480 --> 00:08:05,000
Oh, I beg your pardon.

146
00:08:05,000 --> 00:08:08,340
It's not like I'm referring to Reigen-san.

147
00:08:08,340 --> 00:08:12,170
I'm sure he was trying to liven things
up for the sake of the program.

148
00:08:12,170 --> 00:08:15,000
But I can guarantee that we
didn't ask him to do that.

149
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:19,040
What? Really? Poor Fukuda-kun.

150
00:08:19,040 --> 00:08:20,810
It was basically torture.

151
00:08:20,810 --> 00:08:24,020
Then what in the world were
you doing for 30 minutes?

152
00:08:24,020 --> 00:08:25,650
Some new kind of dance?

153
00:08:27,160 --> 00:08:31,000
I mean... It appeared as though that
boy was possessed by some spirit...

154
00:08:31,000 --> 00:08:32,750
So I exorcised it.

155
00:08:32,750 --> 00:08:35,030
Even if he was merely acting
like he was possessed,

156
00:08:35,030 --> 00:08:37,070
spirits could come by at any moment.

157
00:08:37,070 --> 00:08:41,100
What? A spirit was here?
I didn't even notice.

158
00:08:41,100 --> 00:08:42,660
When did it appear?

159
00:08:43,810 --> 00:08:44,870
About 30 minutes ago...

160
00:08:44,870 --> 00:08:47,920
Right on the dot! I never knew
evil spirits were so punctual!

161
00:08:51,660 --> 00:08:54,840
What kind of spirit was it? Huh?
What kind of spirit was it?

162
00:08:55,180 --> 00:08:56,550
It was a man...

163
00:08:57,030 --> 00:08:59,510
I think he was German...

164
00:08:59,790 --> 00:09:03,540
Stop it, me! If you say another word...

165
00:09:05,620 --> 00:09:06,900
It was Beethoven.

166
00:09:06,900 --> 00:09:10,770
Du-du-du-dunnn!

167
00:09:12,420 --> 00:09:14,440
Did you watch yesterday's ep
of Supernatural Detective?

168
00:09:14,440 --> 00:09:16,410
I did! I laughed so hard!

169
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:18,010
That was basically a public execution.

170
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:18,370
[Fraud] Reigen Arataka is crazy

171
00:09:18,010 --> 00:09:20,110
That Reigen guy is hilarious!

172
00:09:21,060 --> 00:09:23,910
Looks like Reigen's dug
himself into a hole...

173
00:09:24,270 --> 00:09:26,420
There's no way that guy's a fraud.

174
00:09:26,590 --> 00:09:30,060
I wonder if Reigen-san has
a plan to get out of this.

175
00:09:30,780 --> 00:09:32,750
They're apparently making
a group for his victims.

176
00:09:32,750 --> 00:09:34,040
Wanna go?

177
00:09:34,040 --> 00:09:36,380
But we're not victims, though.

178
00:09:36,650 --> 00:09:38,710
So he was a con artist after all.

179
00:09:38,710 --> 00:09:41,260
It's probably his fault
we aren't getting any job offers.

180
00:09:41,420 --> 00:09:44,220
I knew there was something off about him.

181
00:09:44,490 --> 00:09:47,260
I'm gonna feed the media
even more bullcrap about him!

182
00:09:47,940 --> 00:09:49,940
The Next Day

183
00:09:50,310 --> 00:09:52,620
Hey, I might just be remembering wrong,

184
00:09:52,620 --> 00:09:57,100
but isn't the place you work called
Spirits and Such Consultation Office?

185
00:09:57,100 --> 00:09:58,070
It is.

186
00:09:58,070 --> 00:10:02,390
Th-Then is your master's name...
Reigen Arataka?

187
00:10:02,390 --> 00:10:03,790
Huh? Yeah, it is.

188
00:10:03,790 --> 00:10:05,900
Y-You haven't heard?

189
00:10:05,900 --> 00:10:10,450
Your master's getting bashed like crazy
on TV and the Internet!

190
00:10:12,650 --> 00:10:15,800
We're getting a lot more actual jobs now.

191
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,430
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

192
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,430
The star psychic of the 21st century
who defeated Ohiki-san

193
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:17,430
Welcome to
Reigen Arataka's
homepage!

194
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:20,130
If I become famous, I might be able to
break through to other media platforms.

195
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:24,440
That's all part of his plan.

196
00:10:24,930 --> 00:10:26,890
We're closed today

197
00:10:26,890 --> 00:10:30,650
Unknown

198
00:10:29,180 --> 00:10:31,340
Did he really think people
wouldn't find out?

199
00:10:31,340 --> 00:10:33,020
And he calls himself a spirit medium?

200
00:10:33,020 --> 00:10:35,440
I've actually been a victim
of spiritual fraud myself.

201
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:38,280
The "Self-Proclaimed" Psychic. Isn't He a Fraud?

202
00:10:35,720 --> 00:10:38,280
They wanted to undress for an exorcism.

203
00:10:42,370 --> 00:10:44,660
God damn it! I was set up!

204
00:10:44,660 --> 00:10:46,820
Those conniving bastards!

205
00:10:46,820 --> 00:10:50,290
They used me as a scapegoat to boost
their ratings for like 30 seconds?!

206
00:10:50,510 --> 00:10:52,960
That conniving old man!

207
00:10:53,190 --> 00:10:57,130
For now, I need to contain this and ensure
I don't become an even bigger meme.

208
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,920
Anonymous Table Salt
Dat name tho lololololololololololol

209
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:57,920
Anonymous Table Salt
Reigen's the real deal.
He's actually performed an exorcism on me, and my
shoulders and back feel so much lighter now.
I felt better immediately.

210
00:10:58,010 --> 00:10:58,880
Anonymous Table Salt
I bet that's Reigen, isn't it?

211
00:10:58,880 --> 00:11:00,870
Gah! They figured me out!

