00:11:04,470 --> 00:11:05,600
Criminal
Anonymous Table Salt

218
00:11:04,470 --> 00:11:05,600
Okay, Rüppell's fox

219
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,850
Get lost, you fraud
Anonymous Table Salt

220
00:11:05,720 --> 00:11:06,850
Do you even realize you're a criminal?

221
00:11:06,970 --> 00:11:08,100
Reigen's watching~

222
00:11:08,230 --> 00:11:09,480
I found Reigen's high school graduation photo lolol

223
00:11:09,730 --> 00:11:11,810
Is that how it's gonna be,
you little bastards?

224
00:11:11,810 --> 00:11:16,820
Like I'd let a bunch of little shits who
don't know a thing about hard work beat me!

225
00:11:17,640 --> 00:11:20,310
But the title and reputation of
"scam artist psychic"

226
00:11:20,310 --> 00:11:24,030
