228
00:11:29,780 --> 00:11:30,830
You can't be serious!

229
00:11:30,830 --> 00:11:32,910
This isn't true at all!

230
00:11:32,910 --> 00:11:36,700
How dare they spread these lies about me?

231
00:11:35,630 --> 00:11:38,130
Self-Proclaimed New Star of the Psychic World
Reigen: The Scam Artist Psychic
His Unbelievably Bold Tricks!!!

232
00:11:41,010 --> 00:11:42,890
Happy Trails

233
00:11:41,660 --> 00:11:42,890
So basically,

234
00:11:43,130 --> 00:11:47,320
I need you guys all to be my witnesses to
stop these guys from calling me a fraud.

235
00:11:47,650 --> 00:11:49,780
All you have to do is talk to the media.

236
00:11:50,680 --> 00:11:51,430
Huh?

237
00:11:51,980 --> 00:11:54,310
Hey, why aren't you being
as annoying as usual?

238
00:11:54,310 --> 00:11:56,260
Leave, now.

239
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:58,280
You can't fool us anymore.

240
00:11:58,280 --> 00:11:59,410
Huh?

241
00:11:59,410 --> 00:12:01,240
Hey, you can't be serious!

242
00:12:01,240 --> 00:12:04,870
You probably thought we were prime prey!

243
00:12:04,870 --> 00:12:06,740
We're not falling for that!

244
00:12:06,740 --> 00:12:10,450
And here I thought he was a little cute, too!

245
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:15,550
Well, I guess the only thing I can do now
is wait until this all blows over.

246
00:12:16,170 --> 00:12:19,220
What the heck? Are they actually
staking out my place?

247
00:12:20,520 --> 00:12:22,170
There he is! That's Reigen Arataka!

248
00:12:22,340 --> 00:12:23,380
Shit!

249
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:23,920
Don't run away!

250
00:12:23,920 --> 00:12:24,470
Wait!

251
00:12:24,470 --> 00:12:27,200
What was that so-called exorcism
you performed on that show?

252
00:12:27,200 --> 00:12:30,320
Don't you think you need
to explain yourself?

253
00:12:30,320 --> 00:12:31,970
You could at least give us some answers!

254
00:12:31,970 --> 00:12:33,660
Are you off today?

255
00:12:33,660 --> 00:12:36,190
The people aren't going to
be satisfied with this!

256
00:12:36,410 --> 00:12:38,590
Everyone has their eye on you!

257
00:12:38,210 --> 00:12:39,150
Yeah!

258
00:12:38,590 --> 00:12:40,050
You can't run from this!

259
00:12:39,150 --> 00:12:40,350
A press conference!

260
00:12:39,470 --> 00:12:41,340
How about holding a press conference?

261
00:12:41,340 --> 00:12:41,900
Huh?

262
00:12:42,650 --> 00:12:44,050
A press conference?

263
00:12:45,850 --> 00:12:48,280
Reigen Arataka, the man
who's garnered attention

264
00:12:48,280 --> 00:12:50,680
for allegedly conning people
with psychic scams,

265
00:12:50,680 --> 00:12:53,210
announced that he will be holding
a press conference tomorrow.

266
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:55,890
We believe the subjects that
will be discussed will include

267
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:57,040
Alleged Psychic Scammer

268
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:57,040
Plans to Hold a Press Conference

269
00:12:53,210 --> 00:12:57,040
Reigen Arataka

270
00:12:55,890 --> 00:12:58,140
if his previous activities
were indeed illegal,

271
00:12:58,140 --> 00:13:00,120
and if he actually even
possesses spiritual powers.

272
00:12:58,800 --> 00:12:59,850
That's...

273
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,340
To Arataka – From Mom

274
00:13:04,880 --> 00:13:06,340
I'll show you a top secret way to...

275
00:13:07,260 --> 00:13:10,720
You seem to be in a lot of trouble.
I prepared an apology for you to say at the press conference,
so if you get in trouble, just read that.
Learn your lesson from this,
quit this scamming business, and get a real job.
I know your dad doesn't say it much, but he's worried about you.
You should come home. You haven't been home lately at all.
This is the perfect opportunity for us to all have a family meeting.
I'm on your side.

276
00:13:12,980 --> 00:13:14,390
Apology

277
00:13:14,310 --> 00:13:15,440
Thank you all for gathering here today.
I'm sorry that you all had to take the time
to show up today over my own personal actions.
First of all, I'd like to apologize to all the people I've troubled,
as well as to all of their friends and family members I may have burdened.
I'd like to take this opportunity to formally apologize to everyone.
I'm so terribly sorry for everything I've done.
(Now, bow. Hold for 2 minutes.)

278
00:13:15,440 --> 00:13:17,810
(1 day ago)

279
00:13:18,320 --> 00:13:21,580
Man... It'll be morning soon.

280
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:25,950
Mob Psycho

281
00:13:25,950 --> 00:13:27,110
Mob Psycho

282
00:13:32,410 --> 00:13:32,990
He's here!

283
00:13:32,990 --> 00:13:34,370
Reigen has appeared!

284
00:13:43,230 --> 00:13:44,600
Damn, that's bright.

285
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,800
Shit.

286
00:13:46,530 --> 00:13:50,140
I thought I'd have a chance if
we were just going to argue,

287
00:13:50,420 --> 00:13:52,600
but now my head's completely blank.

288
00:13:53,250 --> 00:13:54,670
Calm down.

289
00:13:54,670 --> 00:13:57,810
First, you need to get the reporters
to have a good impression of you.

290
00:13:58,070 --> 00:14:01,170
F-First, I'd like to thank
you all for gathering...

291
00:14:07,270 --> 00:14:09,070
Why did you all gather here today, anyway?

292
00:14:09,630 --> 00:14:13,080
It's pretty common to suddenly get tired
of all this shit at the last minute.

293
00:14:13,080 --> 00:14:14,280
What's with that attitude?!

294
00:14:14,280 --> 00:14:15,080
What?!

295
00:14:15,080 --> 00:14:16,420
Are you mocking us?!

296
00:14:16,420 --> 00:14:18,580
You're the one who said you'd
hold a press conference!

297
00:14:19,020 --> 00:14:21,630
That's because you guys kept
stalking me to my house.

298
00:14:21,630 --> 00:14:24,210
You basically made me hold this thing.

299
00:14:24,890 --> 00:14:28,340
I have a few questions regarding
the fraudulent acts you've committed.

300
00:14:28,510 --> 00:14:29,870
Hang on a sec.

301
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:32,300
By "fraudulent acts," are you
referring to my business?

302
00:14:32,620 --> 00:14:37,460
Is there anyone here that can actually prove
I don't have any spiritual powers?

303
00:14:37,460 --> 00:14:40,770
Or maybe any victims who can
prove they've been scammed?

304
00:14:40,940 --> 00:14:43,480
There are a lot of people who've
reported that they've been scammed—

305
00:14:43,630 --> 00:14:45,320
Right. Self-proclaimed "victims."

306
00:14:45,620 --> 00:14:47,530
Why are you saying it like that?!

307
00:14:47,860 --> 00:14:50,230
Because it hasn't been proven.

308
00:14:50,380 --> 00:14:53,980
Unless and until they are,
I can still call myself a psychic.

309
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:55,200
I'm not a criminal.

310
00:14:55,530 --> 00:14:57,660
I'd be careful with how you
phrase things if I were you.

311
00:14:58,780 --> 00:15:00,170
All right, I have a question.

312
00:15:00,350 --> 00:15:01,410
Go ahead.

313
00:15:01,410 --> 00:15:03,890
Do you actually have spiritual powers?

314
00:15:03,890 --> 00:15:05,630
No comment.

315
00:15:05,630 --> 00:15:07,420
Recording

316
00:15:05,850 --> 00:15:07,420
Why won't you answer?

317
00:15:07,910 --> 00:15:11,240
Because you won't be satisfied
unless I say "no."

318
00:15:11,240 --> 00:15:14,640
I can't prove that I have spiritual powers
since you all lack them yourselves.

319
00:15:14,640 --> 00:15:18,180
Are you really going to try
to talk your way out of this?

320
00:15:18,180 --> 00:15:20,550
Judging from the broadcast the other day,

321
00:15:20,550 --> 00:15:23,010
you do seem like you're
excellent at ad-libbing.

322
00:15:23,820 --> 00:15:24,480
Tch.

323
00:15:25,150 --> 00:15:27,410
Oh? Did you just click your tongue?

324
00:15:27,410 --> 00:15:29,780
No, I was just testing the mics.

325
00:15:30,110 --> 00:15:32,850
Uh-oh, now he's copping an attitude.

326
00:15:32,850 --> 00:15:34,620
This guy's finished.

327
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:38,790
When did you start this
psychic business of yours?

328
00:15:39,100 --> 00:15:40,720
About four years ago.

329
00:15:40,720 --> 00:15:42,440
What were you doing prior to that?

330
00:15:42,820 --> 00:15:44,290
I worked at some company.

331
00:15:44,730 --> 00:15:47,230
Did that company have anything
to do with psychics?

332
00:15:47,230 --> 00:15:48,870
No, not at all.

333
00:15:49,440 --> 00:15:50,970
He's actually answering the questions.

334
00:15:51,650 --> 00:15:54,210
What kind of problems did
people come to you with?

335
00:15:54,210 --> 00:15:57,530
Stiff shoulders, spirit photos, and stuff.

336
00:15:57,530 --> 00:15:59,330
Did they see any results?

337
00:15:59,330 --> 00:16:00,850
Those cases have been solved.

338
00:16:00,850 --> 00:16:04,180
Any particular case that stands out?

339
00:16:04,180 --> 00:16:05,810
Getting rid of some urban legends.

340
00:16:06,340 --> 00:16:08,730
Have you ever had any
conflicts with your clients?

341
00:16:08,730 --> 00:16:09,540
I have not.

342
00:16:09,540 --> 00:16:12,550
Have you ever sold any expensive
salt or prayer beads?

343
00:16:12,550 --> 00:16:13,950
I have not.

344
00:16:13,950 --> 00:16:17,730
Apparently, information about when you were
a student is spreading over the Internet.

345
00:16:17,730 --> 00:16:18,950
That doesn't matter.

346
00:16:19,330 --> 00:16:23,230
According to your graduation
essay, you wrote this...

347
00:16:23,230 --> 00:16:24,670
"I want to be somebody."

348
00:16:29,430 --> 00:16:32,550
What made you get into the psychic business?

349
00:16:35,370 --> 00:16:37,050
Why?

350
00:16:37,390 --> 00:16:39,890
Reigen-san looks pretty pale...

351
00:16:40,050 --> 00:16:43,100
D-Don't keep making the
media outlets your enemy.

352
00:16:43,260 --> 00:16:46,060
How wonderful. He's at a loss for words.

353
00:16:46,450 --> 00:16:49,110
Something's wrong.
He doesn't have his usual zing.

354
00:16:49,430 --> 00:16:51,120
Great Master Reigen...

355
00:16:51,120 --> 00:16:52,320
What's wrong?

356
00:16:52,900 --> 00:16:56,530
Why did I decide to live as a psychic?

357
00:16:57,040 --> 00:17:00,330
It's not like it's lucrative,
and it's usually troublesome.

358
00:17:00,690 --> 00:17:02,180
Thinking back,

359
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:02,700
Clincity

360
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:02,700
Super delicious!
The next generation

361
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:02,700
water dispenser

362
00:17:01,410 --> 00:17:02,700
The ultimate
natural spring
water to keep
you healthy

363
00:17:02,180 --> 00:17:04,330
there was a time when
I always did everything efficiently

364
00:17:04,490 --> 00:17:07,210
and was filled with curiosity
about everything.

365
00:17:07,750 --> 00:17:11,920
But then I got bored, quit my job,
and rented that office on a whim.

366
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:17,470
I ended up getting into this facade of a
job because of an ad I saw in a magazine.

367
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:15,130
Power Stone

368
00:17:13,670 --> 00:17:15,130
You can become a
millionaire, too!!

369
00:17:18,110 --> 00:17:21,740
That's right... I actually
meant to quit a long time ago.

370
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:25,350
3
Years
Ago

371
00:17:22,100 --> 00:17:25,350
Spirits and Such Consultation Office

372
00:17:23,380 --> 00:17:25,350
Thank you very much!

373
00:17:25,540 --> 00:17:28,270
My body felt so heavy,
but now I'm fine!

374
00:17:30,630 --> 00:17:32,570
Man, I'm bored.

375
00:17:32,570 --> 00:17:35,510
As it stands, I'm no
different from a masseur.

376
00:17:35,510 --> 00:17:37,280
Guess it's about time to wrap things up.

377
00:17:39,320 --> 00:17:40,910
I wonder what I should do next.

378
00:17:41,220 --> 00:17:43,560
Being a PI sounds pretty fun,

379
00:17:43,560 --> 00:17:47,000
but maybe not, since apparently they mostly
do investigations on cheating spouses.

380
00:17:48,120 --> 00:17:49,470
Excuse me.

381
00:17:49,470 --> 00:17:51,470
I came here because I saw your sign.

382
00:17:51,470 --> 00:17:52,600
Sure thing.

383
00:17:53,070 --> 00:17:54,510
How may I help you?

384
00:17:54,510 --> 00:17:56,550
Er... Oh, it's just a kid.

385
00:17:57,550 --> 00:17:59,630
What do you want, boy?

386
00:17:59,630 --> 00:18:02,010
Um, I'm an esper.

387
00:18:02,550 --> 00:18:03,560
Wha?

388
00:18:03,560 --> 00:18:06,620
There are times when I can't
control my powers very well,

389
00:18:06,620 --> 00:18:07,790
and it's scary.

390
00:18:07,790 --> 00:18:10,620
You shitty little brat.
This must be a prank.

391
00:18:11,010 --> 00:18:14,070
Did someone tell you to
come here and tell me that?

392
00:18:14,230 --> 00:18:17,330
No. I haven't been able to
talk to anyone about this.

393
00:18:17,330 --> 00:18:20,990
I thought you might be the same as me...

394
00:18:21,190 --> 00:18:23,450
If I tried, I could see spirits, too.

395
00:18:23,970 --> 00:18:27,410
A pathological liar?
No, maybe it's an overactive imagination.

396
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:32,000
Either way, he seems rather troubled by this.

397
00:18:32,900 --> 00:18:34,470
Well, come on in.

398
00:18:35,810 --> 00:18:36,720
Okay.

399
00:18:38,130 --> 00:18:40,550
I was troubled a lot when I was a kid, too.

400
00:18:42,000 --> 00:18:43,350
What's with this kid?

401
00:18:43,760 --> 00:18:45,930
He's staring at me with
eyes brimming with hope.

402
00:18:45,930 --> 00:18:47,930
This is serious.

403
00:18:47,930 --> 00:18:50,890
This kid's in his own fantasy world.

404
00:18:50,890 --> 00:18:52,820
I'll just come up with something
to get him to go home.

405
00:18:53,770 --> 00:18:57,250
Listen. Just because you have psychic powers

406
00:18:57,250 --> 00:18:59,700
doesn't make you any less human.

407
00:19:00,080 --> 00:19:02,180
It's the same as people who are fast,
people who are book smart,

408
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:04,140
and people with strong body odor.

409
00:19:04,140 --> 00:19:07,210
Psychic powers are just
another characteristic.

410
00:19:08,160 --> 00:19:12,740
You must embrace that as a part of
yourself and continue to live positively.

411
00:19:13,060 --> 00:19:15,630
The truth behind one's charm is kindness.

412
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:18,590
Become a good person. That is all.

413
00:19:20,220 --> 00:19:22,550
May I come to talk to you again?

414
00:19:22,780 --> 00:19:26,260
Yeah, I don't know about that.
I'm pretty busy, you know?

415
00:19:26,260 --> 00:19:28,520
Anyway, you should go home for tod— Hot!

416
00:19:28,790 --> 00:19:29,980
Hey, don't get bur—

417
00:19:35,070 --> 00:19:40,030
Hey... You said you could
see ghosts, too, right?

418
00:19:41,550 --> 00:19:43,920
Do you know how to exorcise them, too?

419
00:19:46,980 --> 00:19:49,410
All right. Come again tomorrow
around the same time.

420
00:19:49,410 --> 00:19:50,910
What? Really?

421
00:19:51,220 --> 00:19:53,920
I'll show you how to use your powers.

422
00:19:55,960 --> 00:20:00,050
Back then, I couldn't help but admire
this kid that walked into my life.

423
00:20:00,890 --> 00:20:03,040
I wanted to grasp something for myself, too.

424
00:20:03,710 --> 00:20:05,930
I wanted to become someone special.

425
00:20:07,430 --> 00:20:09,390
Yet this is the result.

426
00:20:10,060 --> 00:20:12,870
I haven't changed at all since then.

427
00:20:12,870 --> 00:20:15,470
I just kept using him.

428
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:19,190
In the end, I couldn't become anything.

429
00:20:19,910 --> 00:20:24,860
Maybe I was the one who was holding
him back from his youth the most.

430
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:28,580
Man, I said something really awful back then.

431
00:20:29,330 --> 00:20:33,170
He wanted to change,
and yet I tried to cage him in.

432
00:20:37,620 --> 00:20:41,120
Hey, Mob... Are you watching?

433
00:20:39,460 --> 00:20:40,710
Karaoke

434
00:20:42,220 --> 00:20:44,010
# Reigen Arataka
58,699 tweets

435
00:20:50,730 --> 00:20:53,410
You've grown up so much. You know that?

436
00:20:55,840 --> 00:20:57,190
That doesn't answer anything!

437
00:20:57,190 --> 00:20:58,150
What kind of answer is that?!

438
00:20:58,150 --> 00:20:59,720
What was that silence?

439
00:20:59,720 --> 00:21:00,890
Who was that message to?

440
00:21:00,890 --> 00:21:02,080
We don't understand!

441
00:21:02,080 --> 00:21:03,580
Answer us!

442
00:21:04,720 --> 00:21:06,030
It's an earthquake!

443
00:21:07,890 --> 00:21:11,000
We are experiencing an extremely
powerful earthquake!

444
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:11,490
Psychics exist.
Says the psychic #Press

445
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:11,490
FlyingNightingale @uguisu5987  –57 seconds ago

446
00:21:11,000 --> 00:21:11,490
So cool                  #PressConference

447
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:12,250
Tsuchi @tsutiku0 –35 seconds ago

448
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:12,250
Anacatesthesia FTW #PressConference

449
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:12,250
ThrowAway303 @nagee566 –41 seconds ago

450
00:21:11,540 --> 00:21:12,250
I feel the power    #PressConference

451
00:21:12,330 --> 00:21:12,960
Che @0015putfesee –23 seconds ago

452
00:21:12,330 --> 00:21:12,960
CG technology is getting incredible lately  #Press

453
00:21:13,140 --> 00:21:15,060
Where's this press conference being held?

454
00:21:16,550 --> 00:21:18,170
O-Our cameras!

455
00:21:18,170 --> 00:21:21,630
Spirit

456
00:21:18,490 --> 00:21:21,630
I-Is Reigen doing this?!

457
00:21:21,630 --> 00:21:22,850
Telekinesis?!

458
00:21:22,850 --> 00:21:24,300
Such incredible power!

459
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:26,680
Naritasan

460
00:21:24,530 --> 00:21:26,680
That doesn't seem like Reigen-san.

461
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:29,300
This is getting serious...

462
00:21:29,780 --> 00:21:31,570
Nii-san! Nii-san!

463
00:21:32,040 --> 00:21:34,600
How can you remain so calm?!

464
00:21:34,600 --> 00:21:36,980
Are you the one doing this?!

465
00:21:37,210 --> 00:21:39,160
P-Please do something!

466
00:21:39,160 --> 00:21:40,980
Is this due to your spiritual powers?

467
00:21:42,700 --> 00:21:45,700
Gee, I wonder what's going on.

468
00:21:45,700 --> 00:21:47,270
Please, stop this!

469
00:21:47,270 --> 00:21:48,930
What the hell's going on?!

470
00:21:49,260 --> 00:21:51,160
Are you done asking me if I'm a fraud or not?

471
00:21:53,590 --> 00:21:56,620
In that case, I'll be ending
this press conference.

472
00:21:56,620 --> 00:21:57,810
H-Hey!

473
00:21:57,810 --> 00:21:59,340
What's going to happen to us?!

474
00:21:59,560 --> 00:22:00,600
Beats me.

475
00:22:00,600 --> 00:22:03,900
You should probably concentrate
on finding your next big story.

476
00:22:10,440 --> 00:22:12,140
One of the lights fell!

477
00:22:12,140 --> 00:22:14,890
One moment please

478
00:22:14,890 --> 00:22:18,600
Cola

479
00:22:15,200 --> 00:22:17,760
What the hell was that? Such bullshit.

480
00:22:18,600 --> 00:22:21,730
Cornered
~True Identity~

481
00:22:35,100 --> 00:22:37,920
Why... are you here?

482
00:22:38,940 --> 00:22:40,170
Just because.

483
00:22:40,780 --> 00:22:45,170
Let's get the hell out of here.
They're gonna be running around for a while.

484
00:22:50,630 --> 00:22:53,760
Hey... Do you know?

485
00:22:54,180 --> 00:22:55,920
Know what?

486
00:22:55,920 --> 00:22:57,520
What I really am...

487
00:22:58,110 --> 00:23:00,310
Haven't you seen any of the stuff
on the web or magazines?

488
00:23:01,600 --> 00:23:04,910
I've always known... from the beginning.

489
00:23:07,840 --> 00:23:10,980
What my master really is...

490
00:23:16,520 --> 00:23:17,790
is a genuinely good guy.

491
00:23:38,320 --> 00:23:39,520
Man, I'm starving.

492
00:23:39,980 --> 00:23:41,880
Let's have some ramen and head home.

493
00:23:41,880 --> 00:23:42,650
Okay.

494
00:23:44,960 --> 00:23:49,450
Oh, by the way, Master, happy birthday.

495
00:23:55,610 --> 00:23:58,120
Mob's finally telling Tsubomi-chan
how he really feels about her?

496
00:23:58,120 --> 00:24:00,910
And he's going to try to place
within the top 10 in a marathon?

497
00:24:00,910 --> 00:24:02,920
Welp, looks like he's going to need my help.

498
00:24:03,310 --> 00:24:05,540
Next time on Mob Psycho 100 II Episode 8:

499
00:24:05,540 --> 00:24:06,920
"Even Then ~Continue Forward~."

500
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:09,480
First-press limited edition?
That is the absolute best decision.

501
00:24:06,920 --> 00:24:10,210
Even Then
~Continue Forward~
